# Extras for the cloud training image, on top of requirements-runtime.lock (torch CPU, numpy,
# pillow, opencv). Pins mirror requirements.txt, which produced the committed dataset hash.
# `make lock-train` resolves these against the runtime lock and merges both into
# requirements-train.lock (the only file the training image installs).
